.Xr X509_get_notBefore 3
and
.Xr X509_get_notAfter 3
were deprecated in OpenSSL 1.1.0.
.Pp
.Fn X509_ACERT_get0_notBefore ,
.Fn X509_ACERT_get0_notAfter ,
.Fn X509_ACERT_set1_notBefore ,
.Fn X509_ACERT_set1_notAfter
were added in OpenSSL 3.4.
